      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">突破触发后的限价或更好价格（如果已成交）</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td8da0c5dc34f8e63",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Triggered limit order may remain unfilled</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">已触发的限价单可能仍未成交</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tabd301cf1478c757",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A standard Buy Stop or Sell Stop therefore does not provide price certainty after activation. Once its stop condition is reached, the corresponding market operation is activated.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">因此，标准突破买入或突破卖出在激活后不提供价格确定性。一旦达到其突破条件，就会激活相应的市场操作。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td73dc1907edb44f8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Market Order vs Limit Order: Which Should You Use?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">市价单与限价单：您应该使用哪个？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t80e9900f18b335cf",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Planned Pullback</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">计划回调</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t818e902a73da0d1a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Limit Order vs Stop Order: What's the Real Difference?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">限价订单与突破订单：真正的区别是什么？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8933832e7c0435d4",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A limit order normally waits for a more favorable entry price, while a stop order waits for price to cross a trigger before activating.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">限价单通常等待更有利的入场价格，而突破单则等待价格穿过触发点后再激活。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4f656727d9ec220f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For buy orders:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">对于买单：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te75b38100e1840c6",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Buy Stop: normally above current market price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">突破买入：通常高于当前市场价格。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3ee8a789ac6e7697",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For sell orders:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">对于卖单：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t487fd870a1cfe8f2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Sell Stop: normally below current market price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">突破卖出：通常低于当前市场价格。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t972f1a566421f130",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A trader expecting a pullback before continuation might use a limit order.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">预期原有走势继续之前先出现回调的交易者，可能会使用限价单。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb256147eb81fc8e2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A trader who only wants to enter after price crosses a breakout level might use a stop order.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">只想在价格突破突破水平后入场的交易者可能会使用突破单。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8ade3a16967f9d84",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">That placement logic is the key distinction when comparing a stop order vs limit order.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在比较突破单与限价单时，放置逻辑是关键区别。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb6d22b1d71cb654d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Limit Order vs Stop-Limit Order</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">限价订单与突破回踩订单</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9f193f6d1fb739fd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">So in a limit order vs stop limit order comparison, the additional trigger determines when the limit instruction is created.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">因此，在限价订单与突破回踩订单的比较中，附加触发器决定何时创建限价指令。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2c028695ca1c71b1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Entry Trigger</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
